<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation falls to 5.98 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation falls to 5.98 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index fell to 5.98 percent in the week ended May 3 from 6.35 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES	May 3	 April 26	May 4, 1996</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +5.98	 +6.35	   +4.57</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  322.3	 323.4	   304.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended May 4, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
